{"step_index":225,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:27:07Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-21T15:57:07+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-21T15:57:08+05:30\nShowing lines 1520-1590 of 1887\n1520:     const stripCo2 = document.getElementById('strip-co2');\n1521:     if (stripCo2) stripCo2.textContent = `-${res.co2Offset} kg`;\n1522: \n1523:     const stripVeh = document.getElementById('strip-vehicles-saved');\n1524:     if (stripVeh) stripVeh.textContent = `${res.soloCarsSaved} ${res.soloCarsSaved === 1 ? 'Car' : 'Cars'}`;\n1525: \n1526:     if (sliderFareDisplay) sliderFareDisplay.textContent = `$${res.fare}`;\n1527:   }\n1528: \n1529:   const btnCalcRoute = document.getElementById('btn-calc-route');\n1530:   if (btnCalcRoute) btnCalcRoute.addEventListener('click', computeAndDisplayRoute);\n1531: \n1532:   const btnSimDrive = document.getElementById('btn-simulate-drive');\n1533:   if (btnSimDrive) {\n1534:     btnSimDrive.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1535:       if (urbanCanvasInstance) {\n1536:         urbanCanvasInstance.startCarSimulation();\n1537:         showPlatformToast('Simulating top-down electric transit drive along route corridors!', 'blue');\n1538:       }\n1539:     });\n1540:   }\n1541: \n1542:   const btnSwapRoute = document.getElementById('btn-swap-route');\n1543:   if (btnSwapRoute && originSel && destSel) {\n1544:     btnSwapRoute.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1545:       const temp = originSel.value;\n1546:       originSel.value = destSel.value;\n1547:       destSel.value = temp;\n1548:       computeAndDisplayRoute();\n1549:     });\n1550:   }\n1551: \n1552:   const btnResetView = document.getElementById('btn-reset-view');\n1553:   if (btnResetView && urbanCanvasInstance) {\n1554:     btnResetView.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1555:       urbanCanvasInstance.resetCamera();\n1556:     });\n1557:   }\n1558: \n1559:   // --- Passenger Request ---\n1560:   const btnRequestRide = document.getElementById('btn-request-ride');\n1561:   if (btnRequestRide) {\n1562:     btnRequestRide.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1563:       const nameInput = document.getElementById('passenger-name-input');\n1564:       const rawName = nameInput ? nameInput.value : '';\n1565:       const name = rawName.trim() || `Commuter_${Math.floor(Math.random() * 900 + 100)}`;\n1566:       const pickup = passPickup ? passPickup.value : 'ALPHA';\n1567:       const drop = passDrop ? passDrop.value : 'HORIZON';\n1568: \n1569:       if (pickup === drop) {\n1570:         showPlatformToast('Pickup and drop-off stations must be distinct.', 'rose');\n1571:         return;\n1572:       }\n1573: \n1574:       const passenger = engine.submitRideRequest(name, pickup, drop);\n1575:       if (nameInput) nameInput.value = '';\n1576:       refreshPlatformUI();\n1577:       showPlatformToast(`Ride request submitted for ${passenger.name} (${pickup} → ${drop}).`, 'emerald');\n1578:     });\n1579:   }\n1580: \n1581:   const btnCancelFrontReq = document.getElementById('btn-cancel-front-req');\n1582:   if (btnCancelFrontReq) {\n1583:     btnCancelFrontReq.addEventListener('click', () => {\n1584:       const dequeued = engine.dequeueNextRequest();\n1585:       if (dequeued) {\n1586:         refreshPlatformUI();\n1587:         showPlatformToast(`Cancelled request for ${dequeued.name} (${dequeued.id}).`, 'amber');\n1588:       } else {\n1589:         showPlatformToast('No pending passenger requests in the pipeline.', 'rose');\n1590:       }"}
{"step_index":226,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:27:08Z","input_tokens":3362,"cache_read_tokens":156141,"output_tokens":683,"content":"# 🌿 UI Decongestion & Layout Modernization Complete\n\nThe user interface has been redesigned and spaced out to resolve the congested layout shown in your screenshot.\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Key Root Causes Identified from the Screenshot\n1. **Vertical Element Collisions**: In Tab 1, all form selectors, the swap button, action buttons, the commuter density slider, and the 3D map canvas were compressed into a single narrow column, forcing the buttons and slider labels into a cramped stack above the canvas.\n2. **Missing Grid Spatial Separation**: The Origin/Destination fields were stacked awkwardly on top of the 3D map instead of running alongside in a balanced two-column dashboard layout.\n3. **Cramped Tab Navigation**: The top navigation badges and buttons lacked breathing room, causing line wrapping on mid-sized viewports.\n\n---\n\n### ✨ Architectural & Visual Fixes Applied\n\n1. **Spacious 2-Column Responsive Workspace ([`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) & [`styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/styles.css))**:\n   - **Left Column (`420px`)**: Dedicated, clean configuration panel containing:\n     - Clear station dropdowns with dedicated labels and icons.\n     - Centered swap station button.\n     - Full-width Commuter Density Slider with clear tick markers and dynamic **Seat Fare badge**.\n     - Primary action buttons (**Calculate Route** and **Drive**).\n   - **Right Column (`1fr`)**: Dedicated **3D Spatial Metropolitan Canvas (`480px` height)** with ample room for 3D orbital rotation and zoom, accompanied below by the 5-item Telemetry Impact Strip.\n\n2. **Clean Navigation Bar & KPI Ribbon**:\n   - Spaced out tab buttons with modern pill badges.\n   - Clean 4-column KPI metric cards with high-contrast icons and typography.\n\n3. **Responsive Breakpoints**:\n   - At wide viewports ($>1080\\text{px}$): Balanced side-by-side columns with no overlapping text.\n   - At smaller viewports ($\\le 1080\\text{px}$): Clean single-column layout with consistent padding and no cramped text.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to View the Updated UI\nOpen [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html) in your browser (or press refresh if already open). The dashboard now opens into an airy, uncluttered layout with balanced spatial proportions."}
