{"step_index":235,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-21T10:31:25Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-21T16:01:25+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-10-21T16:01:25+05:30\nPartial read (lines 1-50 of 280). Showing bytes 0-46080 of 94368 in this line range, truncated at the 46080-byte limit. To read the rest of this line range, call this tool again with the same StartLine and EndLine and ByteOffset=46080.\n1: {\"step_index\":0,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T18:45:11Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nCreate a modern, ultra-sleek, interactive Web Application for a \\\"Smart City Logistics – Carpooling System\\\" that visualizes C++ Backend Data Structures and Algorithms in real time.\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n### Visual Theme & Mouse-Driven 3D Effects\\r\\n1. Theme & Aesthetic:\\r\\n   - Dark mode modern smart-city glassmorphism interface (Deep Navy/Charcoal `#0B0F19`, Electric Cyan `#00F3FF`, Emerald Green `#00FF87`, and Amber Amber/Neon Coral accents).\\r\\n   - Crisp typography, interactive UI cards with glow borders on hover.\\r\\n\\r\\n2. Unique 3D Anti-Gravity Hover Effect:\\r\\n   - Implement a dynamic 3D perspective tilt effect on all major UI cards, metrics, and route nodes when the mouse hovers over them.\\r\\n   - Nodes and UI elements should slightly lift towards the user along the Z-axis, with dynamic drop-shadows casting downward relative to the mouse vector.\\r\\n   - The primary city roadmap should feature an interactive 3D spatial canvas where moving the cursor tilts and rotates the city grid in subtle parallax 3D.\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n### Core Interactive Features & Modules\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Interactive 3D City Graph Visualizer (Graph & Min-Heap / Dijkstra):\\r\\n   - A node-based city map representing intersections/cities as 3D visual nodes and edges with route distances/costs.\\r\\n   - Allow users to click any two nodes (Source & Destination) to trigger Dijkstra's Shortest Path Algorithm, animating the Min-Heap node selection visually step-by-step.\\r\\n\\r\\n2. Live Queue & Request Engine (Queue & Circular Queue):\\r\\n   - Incoming Passenger Queue: Visualized as a dynamic horizontal queue pipeline (FIFO).\\r\\n   - Circular Waiting Queue (Capacity 5): Rendered as a glowing, rotatable 3D ring buffer array showing capacity usage (0/5 to 5/5) for unmatched requests.\\r\\n\\r\\n3. Driver & Ride Management Dashboard (Singly & Doubly Linked List, BST, Hash Table):\\r\\n   - Register Driver: Interactive form that pushes new driver nodes into a visual Singly Linked List and inserts into a Hash Table with chaining preview.\\r\\n   - Confirm & Match Ride: Shows active rides in a Doubly Linked List with bidirectional traversal controls, while updating a Binary Search Tree (BST) visualizer sorted by Ride ID.\\r\\n\\r\\n4. Ride Undo Mechanism (Stack LIFO):\\r\\n   - Include an \\\"Undo Latest Ride Confirmation\\\" button backed by a visual stack panel that pops the latest ride, restores the driver's seat count, and syncs all data structures.\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n\\r\\n### C++ Backend & State Integration Architecture\\r\\n- Expose clear data hooks or mock REST endpoints matching C++ structures:\\r\\n  * Array: City list & spatial lookup.\\r\\n  * Singly Linked List: Driver registration catalog.\\r\\n  * Doubly Linked List: Active rides with forward/backward deletion support.\\r\\n  * Queue: Main passenger request queue.\\r\\n  * Circular Queue: Fixed array size 5 waiting list.\\r\\n  * Stack: Undo history stack.\\r\\n  * Hash Table: ID lookup with chaining buckets.\\r\\n  * BST: Ordered ride tree visualization.\\r\\n  * Graph + Min-Heap: Dijkstra shortest route matrix.\\r\\n\\r\\nMake the interface extremely responsive, polished, and intuitive, with fluid hover animations and real-time visual updates across all data structures when an action occurs.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-18T00:15:11+05:30.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\n<USER_SETTINGS_CHANGE>\\nThe user changed setting `Model Selection` from None to Gemini 3.8 Flash (Low). No need to comment on this change if the user doesn't ask about it. If reporting what model you are, please use a human readable name instead of the exact string.\\n</USER_SETTINGS_CHANGE>\"}\n2: {\"step_index\":1,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T18:45:11Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path \\\\\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\\\\\.gemini\\\\\\\\antigravity\\\\\\\\scratch\\\\\\\\smart-city-carpool\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\\\\\.gemini\\\\\\\\antigravity\\\\\\\\scratch\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating project directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create directory for smart city carpool\\\"\"}}]}\n3: {\"step_index\":3,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T18:45:18Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"ArtifactMetadata\":\"{\\\"RequestFeedback\\\":true,\\\"Summary\\\":\\\"Implementation plan for Smart City Logistics - Carpooling System interactive 3D Web Application with real-time C++ DSA visualizers.\\\",\\\"UserFacing\\\":true}\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"# Smart City Logistics – Carpooling System (C++ DSA Live Visualizer)\\\\n\\\\nA modern, ultra-sleek, interactive Web Application visualizing classic C++ Backend Data Structures & Algorithms in real time with 3D mouse parallax, anti-gravity tilt physics, glowing glassmorphic UI, and synced state transitions.\\\\n\\\\n## User Review Required\\\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\\\n> The application will be built as a self-contained, high-performance, single-page web application (HTML5/CSS3/Three.js/Canvas/Modern ES6+) with an embedded virtual C++ Engine / Data Structure core. This guarantees zero-latency, cross-platform interactive animations, 3D Canvas rendering, and real-time step-by-step algorithms execution without requiring native compilers installed on the host.\\\\n\\\\n## Architectural Design & Features\\\\n\\\\n### 1. Visual Theme & 3D Anti-Gravity Physics\\\\n- **Color Palette**: Deep Charcoal/Navy (`#070B14`, `#0B0F19`), Electric Cyan (`#00F3FF`), Emerald Green (`#00FF87`), Neon Amber/Coral (`#FF7355`, `#FFB800`), Purple/Violet (`#A855F7`).\\\\n- **3D Tilt Engine**: Mouse move tracking with 3D perspective transforms (`perspective(1000px) rotateX(...) rotateY(...) translateZ(...)`), dynamic specular lighting, and mouse-vector-driven drop shadows.\\\\n- **Glassmorphism**: Backdrop blur filters, translucent frosted glass cards, subtle neon border gradients, and pulsating energy glow effects.\\\\n\\\\n### 2. Core Modules & Data Structure Visualizations\\\\n- **3D City Graph & Min-Heap (Dijkstra Shortest Path)**:\\\\n  - Interactive spatial canvas with nodes (Hub Alpha, Cyber Terminal, Neo Harbor, Skyport Central, Quantum Park, Metro Core, Horizon Plaza) with weighted edges.\\\\n  - Interactive source/destination selection with step-by-step Min-Heap priority queue visualization, relaxed distances, visited sets, and animated laser beam path highlighting.\\\\n- **Live Queue & Circular Queue (FIFO Pipelines)**:\\\\n  - **Passenger Queue**: Dynamic horizontal conveyor/pipeline showing front, rear, enqueue/dequeue animations with C++ memory/pointer indicators (`head*`, `tail*`).\\\\n  - **\\n<truncated 2262 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Implementation plan for Smart City Logistics Carpooling Visualizer\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\\\\\.gemini\\\\\\\\antigravity\\\\\\\\brain\\\\\\\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\\\\\\\implementation_plan.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Writing implementation plan\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create implementation plan for smart city carpooling