e text-cyan-400\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"stat-queue-count\\\\\\\">0</span>\\\\n        </div>\\\\n        <div class=\\\\\\\"metric-item tilt-card\\\\\\\" data-tilt>\\\\n          <span class=\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\">CIRCUL\\n<truncated 15028 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Created index.html in artifact directory for Smart City Carpooling Visualizer\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\Kartik Bhosle\\\\\\\\.gemini\\\\\\\\antigravity\\\\\\\\brain\\\\\\\\6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a\\\\\\\\index.html\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Writing file\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create index.html in artifacts directory\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n9: {\"step_index\":10,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T18:46:35Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-10-18T00:16:35+05:30\\nCompleted At: 2026-10-18T00:16:36+05:30\\nCreated file file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/index.html with requested content.\\nIf relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\"}\n10: {\"step_index\":11,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-17T18:46:36Z\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"ArtifactMetadata\":\"{\\\"RequestFeedback\\\":false,\\\"Summary\\\":\\\"Styles CSS with 3D anti-gravity tilt physics, neon glow accents, glassmorphic dark theme, and responsive flex/grid layouts.\\\",\\\"UserFacing\\\":true}\",\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"/* ==========================================================================\\\\n   SMART CITY LOGISTICS - CARPOOLING SYSTEM (C++ DSA VISUALIZER)\\\\n   Ultra-Sleek Glassmorphic & 3D Anti-Gravity Hover Theme\\\\n   ========================================================================== */\\\\n\\\\n:root {\\\\n  --bg-deep: #070B14;\\\\n  --bg-card: rgba(14, 21, 37, 0.72);\\\\n  --bg-card-border: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.18);\\\\n  --bg-card-hover-border: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.55);\\\\n  \\\\n  --cyan-primary: #00F3FF;\\\\n  --cyan-glow: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.45);\\\\n  --emerald-primary: #00FF87;\\\\n  --emerald-glow: rgba(0, 255, 135, 0.45);\\\\n  --amber-primary: #FFB800;\\\\n  --amber-glow: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.45);\\\\n  --rose-primary: #FF4D6D;\\\\n  --rose-glow: rgba(255, 77, 109, 0.45);\\\\n  --purple-primary: #A855F7;\\\\n  --purple-glow: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.45);\\\\n\\\\n  --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\\\\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n* {\\\\n  box-sizing: border-box;\\\\n  margin: 0;\\\\n  padding: 0;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nbody {\\\\n  background-color: var(--bg-deep);\\\\n  color: #F1F5F9;\\\\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\\\\n  min-height: 100vh;\\\\n  overflow-x: hidden;\\\\n  position: relative;\\\\n  perspective: 1200px;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n/* Custom Scrollbars */\\\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\\\n  width: 6px;\\\\n  height: 6px;\\\\n}\\\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\\\n  background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.8);\\\\n}\\\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\\\n  background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3);\\\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\\\n}\\\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\\\n  background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.7);\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\n   App Layout & Shell\\\\n   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */\\\\n.app-container {\\\\n  max-width: 1720px;\\\\n  margin: 0 auto;\\\\n  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;\\\\n  display: flex;\\\\n  flex-direction: column;\\\\n  gap: 1.25rem;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n/* Glassmorphic Cards with 3D Tilt Effect */\\\\n.glass-card {\\\\n  background: var(--bg-card);\\\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\\\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\\\\n  b\\n<truncated 20907 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Created styles.css with glassmorphism, 3D anti-gravity tilt sty